<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30080" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκαθ-ίστημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>place</i> or <i>establish in</i>, as king or chief, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὲ . . Μυκήναις ἐγκαταστήσω πάλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					982
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινὰς ἡγεμόνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ τύραννον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					17.10
				</span></i>
			; also, <i>place as a garrison in</i> a place, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				9.15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρουράν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			; of institutions, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. δημοκρατίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					1.18.2
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>establish for oneself</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλείην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hellanic.
					79
				</span></i>
			(a) <i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, with aor. 2, pf. and plpf.
			
				Act.
			, <i>to be established</i> as ruler <i>in</i> a place,
				<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				2.59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.122
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλητῶν νόμῳ ἐγκαθεστώτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.70
				</span></i>
			.</div>
